    add();add(f"**The prespecified all-four-bank conjunction is {s['decision']}.** This study draws four separate 128-board banks from the complete 176-board N12 queen-plus-camel population, refits the original grouped BP AdamW recipe independently for each bank, and compares fixed permutation proposals with arbitrary-cell proposals on the same fresh 4,096-input N13 cohort.")
