    add();add('The 8,000-draw paired-input bootstrap uses RNG 20261114 and retains all three search seeds within each input cluster. The 1.25th and 98.75th percentiles are **98.75% one-sided endpoints per bank**. Bonferroni adjustment gives familywise 95% lower endpoints across the four banks and, separately, familywise 95% upper endpoints. They are **not simultaneous 95% two-sided intervals**. These intervals measure target-input uncertainty conditional on each fitted model; they do not turn four bank draws into a population-level guarantee over future training sets.')
