    add();add('These are exact exhaustive capacity ceilings for the certified primary only. Valid fallbacks can lie outside the zero-F set. Every model contains all 3,808 true target attack pairs but also false exclusions, so this study tests search quality without solving support identification. More bank draws or successful searches cannot remove those structural limits.')
    err=max(x['running_energy_absolute_error_max']for x in s['output_diagnostics']);wrong=sum(r['wrong_stops']for r in s['rows']);changed=sum(x['exact_energy_certificate_count_change']!=0 for x in s['output_diagnostics'])
    add();add(f"The independent audit checks all **{s['audited_timed_target_states']:,} scored target states** against exhaustive target membership, q/givens, output selectors, distinct coverage, proposal/acceptance limits, full integer conflict counts and direct float64 energies. All permutation outputs preserve rows and columns. There are **{wrong} wrong stopped chains**; every stopped state has exact zero conflict count and exact zero energy. Maximum running-energy error is **{err:.9f}**, below the frozen 0.1 gate. Exact-energy reselection changes certificate-first correct counts in **{changed} of {len(s['output_diagnostics'])}** scored jobs; individual outcomes remain in the tracked diagnostics. All capped outputs remain in the analysis.")
    add();add(f"Total GPU-worker cost is **{s['total_gpu_worker_seconds']:.6f} seconds ({s['total_gpu_worker_seconds']/60:.3f} GPU-minutes)**, and whole-study elapsed wall time is **{s['whole_study_wall_seconds']:.6f} seconds**. The four timed fits total {s['fit_seconds_total']:.6f} seconds. Worker costs by phase are {', '.join(f'{k}: {v:.6f}s'for k,v in s['worker_seconds_by_phase'].items())}. Every fit/loss validation, source grid/refinement, warmup and target worker is charged. CPU input preparation preceded the first fit; the single 1,800-second wall deadline then remained in force, with no reset and a 3,600 aggregate GPU-worker-second ceiling.")
