    add();add('[Frozen protocol](protocol.json), [source banks and fitting](source.py), [calibration](calibration.py), [campaign queue](campaign.py), [fresh cohort](prepare.py), [target runner](driver.py), [independent audit](analyze.py), [tracked summary](../../../../results/research/loki/h3ac/summary.json), [per-seed scores/costs](../../../../results/research/loki/h3ac/per_seed.csv), [all calibration receipts](../../../../results/research/loki/h3ac/calibration-selections.json), [source draws](../../../../results/research/loki/h3ac/source-banks.json), [per-input capacity](../../../../results/research/loki/h3ac/per-input-capacity.npz), [figure provenance](../../../../results/research/loki/h3ac/plot-provenance.json).')
